category: Libs
requires: libbuspirate0 pkg-config
sdesc: "C library to talk with the bus pirate hardware (development)"
ldesc: "The libbuspirate is a C library to talk with the bus pirate
hardware in raw, binary scripting mode. The libbuspirate allows to quickly
write a short C program to test interfacing with your favorite hardware."
external-source: libbuspirate

